ementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How to Protect Your Joints and Stay Active After 40<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aae3b3b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"aae3b3b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">1. Move Daily \u2014 But Choose Joint-Friendly Activities<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ca90343 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ca90343\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Your joints were designed to move. So here are the best low-impact exercises for joint health:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Walking (especially on flat surfaces)<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Swimming or water walking<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cycling (stationary or outdoor)<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Elliptical machines<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><strong>In Dubai\u2019s heat, indoor gyms, malls, or swimming pools are excellent options, but avoid excessive:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Jumping<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sudden twisting sports<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Long-distance running without conditioning<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:separator --><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c3aa5b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c3aa5b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2. Strength Training Is Non-Negotiable<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-60a21b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"60a21b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This is where many patients make mistakes.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><strong>Strong muscles = protected joints<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Key areas to strengthen:<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Quadriceps &amp; glutes<\/strong> \u2192 protect knees<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Core muscles<\/strong> \u2192 protect spine<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Rotator cuff &amp; shoulder blade muscles<\/strong> \u2192 protect shoulders<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>You don\u2019t need heavy weights.<br \/>Resistance bands, machines, and body-weight exercises are often safer and more effective.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3102065 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3102065\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"437\" src=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/exercises-for-joint-protection-1024x559.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-10637\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/exercises-for-joint-protection-1024x559.webp 1024w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/exercises-for-joint-protection-300x164.webp 300w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/exercises-for-joint-protection-768x419.webp 768w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/exercises-for-joint-protection-600x327.webp 600w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/exercises-for-joint-protection.webp 1408w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d6e5e5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2d6e5e5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">3. Weight Management: Every Kilo Matters<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bde1e9e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bde1e9e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Here\u2019s a fact I share with patients:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:quote --><\/p>\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>&#8220;<em>Every extra 1 kg of body weight adds <strong>3\u20134 kg of force<\/strong> across the knee joint with each step<\/em>.&#8221;<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/blockquote>\n<p><!-- \/wp:quote --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p><strong>Excess weight:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Accelerates cartilage wear<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Increases inflammation<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Worsens knee and hip arthritis<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Even <strong>5\u201310% weight loss<\/strong> can significantly reduce pain.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61fb654 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"61fb654\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/meet-dr-usama\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Discover more about Dr Usama Saleh and his clients reviews now.<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49f5ed8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"49f5ed8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">4. Protect Your Joints During Daily Life (Not Just Exercise)<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b30ff9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1b30ff9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Joint damage often happens at home